# Querying RMBS trustee data in natural language, prototype results

A language model converts each question into a structured query spec, and a compiler turns the spec into SQL using metric definitions held in code, so the model never does the arithmetic. These results come from a working prototype on synthetic data, covering {{n_deals}} Australian RMBS deals, {{n_loans}} loans and {{n_loan_months}} loan-months, in 2 trustee formats.

